# Browser
# A divided triggered ability's shares at a table (CR 601.2d, 603.3d): Court of Garenbrig's upkeep trigger is asked before it is
# on the stack, and the page still reads it as the ability's own words, so its two +1/+1 counters are counters - the dock
# says "distribute two +1/+1 counters", and each creature on the board that may take one wears its share in the counters'
# tone ("0 counters"), not as damage. Bot1's page divides them as one to its Guerrilla Gorilla and one to Bot2's Llanowar
# Elves, and the monarch's doubling follows.

